stereo-declare (1.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New: Declaration.windows_of() in stereo_declare.py, the one top-level
    window of a set of processes, for a program that draws full side by side
    itself and so has no state file. The C library is unchanged.

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 02:00:00 -0300

stereo-declare (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New release. New: python3-stereo-declare, the module stereo_declare.py: the
    declaration of an X11 or Xwayland window from Python, the window
    discovery of a game from its processes or wiz3D's state file, and the
    state-file reader that wiz3d-run carried. The C library is unchanged.
  * The module's test runs at build time on Xvfb.

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:30:00 -0300

